{
  "name": "AI Error Digest – Daily Failure Summary",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Sticky Note – Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1100,
        -180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 958,
        "content": "## 🤖 AI Error Digest\n\nInstead of a push for every single failure, get **one** calm summary a day: what failed, how often, and what to look at first — written by an LLM.\n\n### How it works\n1. Runs once a day (default 08:00).\n2. Pulls the last 24 h of `error` executions from the n8n API.\n3. Aggregates them by workflow.\n4. An LLM turns the raw counts into a prioritized, plain-language digest.\n5. Delivers it as a single message on the channel you enable.\n\n### Setup\n1. Set `N8N_BASE_URL` and `LOOKBACK_HOURS` in the **Config** node.\n2. Create an n8n API key (**Settings → n8n API**) and add it as a *Header Auth* credential — Name `X-N8N-API-KEY` — on the HTTP Request node.\n3. Add your LLM credential to the **Chat Model** node.\n4. Enable one delivery channel: Slack (default), Telegram, Email or WorkflowBuddy.\n5. **Activate** the workflow.\n\nUsing **WorkflowBuddy** for the alerts? Install the [app](https://apps.apple.com/app/id6760253861), copy your key from **Settings → Push API**, and add it in n8n as a Header Auth credential: `Authorization` / `Bearer wb_…`.\n\n### Customization tips\nSwap **Chat Model** for any chat model node — Anthropic, Gemini, Ollama, Groq — the prompt stays the same. If there were no failures in the window, a short \"all clear\" branch runs instead (disabled by default)."
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ Collect and aggregate\n\nOnce a day, pull the last 24 h of failed executions and group them by workflow.",
        "height": 243,
        "width": 950,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -605,
        -158.0
      ],
      "id": "sticky-section-1-04",
      "name": "Sticky Note – ⚙️ Collect and aggregate"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🧠 Summarize with an LLM\n\n**Chat Model** is OpenAI by default — swap it for any chat model node, the prompt stays the same. No failures in the window takes the *All Clear* branch.",
        "height": 743,
        "width": 750,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        355,
        -178.0
      ],
      "id": "sticky-section-2-04",
      "name": "Sticky Note – 🧠 Summarize with an LLM"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📣 Daily digest — pick your channel\n\nOne message a day. Slack is enabled by default; enable another node and disable Slack. **WorkflowBuddy** sends them as native iOS push — setup in the overview.",
        "height": 803,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1155,
        -298.0
      ],
      "id": "sticky-section-3-04",
      "name": "Sticky Note – 📣 Daily digest — pick your channel"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-schedule",
      "name": "Every Day at 08:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -580,
